1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:03,000
I think my new phone has a problem.

2
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:06,000
OK, let's go right now.

3
00:00:07,000 --> 00:00:09,000
What's the Wi-Fi password at home?

4
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:12,000
Wait for me downstairs for a minute.

5
00:00:13,000 --> 00:00:15,000
I'm outside the corner shop, hurry up.

6
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:18,000
See you at eight tomorrow, don't be late.

7
00:00:19,000 --> 00:00:21,000
Sure, no problem.

8
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:24,000
There's a new show tonight, want to watch?

9
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:27,000
Have you eaten yet?

10
00:00:28,000 --> 00:00:30,000
Not yet, I'll eat later.

11
00:00:31,000 --> 00:00:33,000
OK.

12
00:00:34,000 --> 00:00:36,000
Send this file to my email, please.

13
00:00:37,000 --> 00:00:39,000
Can I borrow your earbuds for a bit?

14
00:00:40,000 --> 00:00:42,000
My phone.

15
00:00:43,000 --> 00:00:45,000
Let's buy some fruit this weekend.

16
00:00:46,000 --> 00:00:48,000
I uploaded the photos to the cloud.

17
00:00:49,000 --> 00:00:51,000
Be careful on the way, text me when you arrive.

18
00:00:52,000 --> 00:00:54,000
This app is pretty good, give it a try.

19
00:00:55,000 --> 00:00:57,000
I'm a bit tired today, I want to sleep early.

20
00:00:58,000 --> 00:01:00,000
Good night, see you tomorrow.
